#. module: account_payment_email_invoices
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_payment_email_invoices/wizard/mail_compose_message.py:0
msgid ""
"The attachments of this email add up to %(total)s, above the %(limit)s limit"
" of the outgoing mail server. If the email is sent as it is, Odoo replaces "
"its attachments with download links in the email body. Remove some "
"attachments if you want them to travel as files."
msgstr ""
"Los adjuntos de este correo suman %(total)s y superan el límite de %(limit)s"
" del servidor de correo saliente. Si se envía así, Odoo reemplaza los "
"adjuntos por enlaces de descarga en el cuerpo del correo. Quite algunos "
"adjuntos si quiere que viajen como archivos."

#. module: account_payment_email_invoices
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_email_invoices.field_res_company__attach_invoices_on_payment_order
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_email_invoices.field_res_config_settings__attach_invoices_on_payment_order
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_payment_email_invoices.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"When a payment order is sent by email, also attach the PDF of the vendor "
"bills and credit notes it settles (the PDF attached to each bill)."
msgstr ""
"Al enviar por correo una orden de pago, adjuntar también el PDF de las "
"facturas y notas de crédito de proveedor que cancela (el PDF adjunto a cada "
"comprobante)."

#. module: account_payment_email_invoices
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_email_invoices.field_res_company__attach_invoices_on_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_email_invoices.field_res_config_settings__attach_invoices_on_receipt
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_payment_email_invoices.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"When a receipt is sent by email, also attach the PDF of the customer "
"invoices and credit notes it settles (the same PDF the customer receives)."
msgstr ""
"Al enviar por correo un recibo, adjuntar también el PDF de las facturas y "
"notas de crédito de cliente que cancela (el mismo PDF que recibe el "
"cliente)."
